    "created_at": "2016-06-17T07:37:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-17T07:37:38Z",
    "body": "In particular, the propagation from HTML body to the viewport (if root doesn't have a background), or root to the viewport, should probably not happen in fullscreen. Otherwise `::backdrop` will hide it. It seems that browsers don't propagate for root if it becomes fullscreen, but do for HTML body.\n\n@tabatkins @fantasai thoughts?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
