    "updated_at": "2016-06-17T09:58:05Z",
    "body": "Also note that a fullscreen body won't have the document level scrollbar because it is in general just a normal block element. So if you want to fullscreen the whole page, you should always request fullscreen on root. I don't think we want to make `body` any more special.\n",
